     "titulo": "Parts of the body",
     "texto": [
      "**眼睛** means eyes, **鼻子**, nose; **嘴**, mouth; **耳朵**, ears. **手** is hand, **脚**, foot; **腿**, leg; **脸**, face; **牙**, tooth.",
      "In Chinese these words are usually used without an article: **我的眼睛** means «my eyes»."
     ],
