     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "At the doctor's office",
     "texto": [
      "**病人** means patient. **量** is to measure and **检查**, to examine. **高** describes something high; when talking about temperature it also means it is raised.",
      "**体温** is a single vocabulary unit: it is not split into «body» and «temperature» when translated."
     ],
